EVALUATION

You may install and use these packages without a paid licence for internal
development, testing, security review, proof of concept, and non-production
staging, for as long as you need and with no reduction in functionality.
Evaluation excludes Production Use, processing live customer data, and
distribution outside the evaluator and its evaluation contractors.

PRODUCTION USE REQUIRES A PAID LICENCE

Production Use of these packages - use to create or modify a PDF in a live
application, service, workflow, or environment for the benefit of you, your
customers, or a third party - requires a paid BonniePDF licence under the
BonniePDF Commercial License Agreement. Digital signing is included with every
paid licence at no additional fee and is not sold separately.

NO TECHNICAL ENFORCEMENT

These packages contain no licence key, activation, telemetry, or remote
validation. They behave identically whether or not a licence has been paid for.
The technical ability to produce a signature is not permission to do so: the
absence of a technical restriction is not a licence, a waiver, or evidence of
permission.

NO WARRANTY OF SIGNATURE VALIDITY

These packages act on cryptographic material you supply or obtain. Nothing in
them warrants that a signature is qualified, admissible, or legally valid in
any jurisdiction. Optional timestamping and certificate validation depend on
third-party services outside our control.

